  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusion in action, through youth and education&#x201D;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Inclusion in action, through youth and education&#x201D;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13E;om projektu je zlep&#x161;enie kvality vzdel&#xE1;vacieho procesu pre &#x17E;iakov s obmedzenou mobilitou na z&#xE1;kladnej &#x161;kole v meste Rogatica. Z projektu bud&#xFA; zak&#xFA;pen&#xE9; tri pr&#xED;stupov&#xE9; rampy, jedna vonkaj&#x161;ia pre hlavn&#xFD; vchod do budovy &#x161;koly a dve intern&#xE9;, ktor&#xE9; prepoja vn&#xFA;torn&#xE9; priestory &#x161;koly.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to improve the quality of the education process for students with limited mobility at the elementary school in the town of Rogatica. The project will involve the purchase of three access ramps, one external ramp for the main entrance of the school building and two internal ramps to connect the interior spaces of the school.</narrative>
  </description>
